<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Lucida Fax"><font size="18"><font color="#ffffff"><b>what were you gazing at?</b></font></font></font></font>

37
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:36,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Byakugan's</font></font>

38
00:01:31,020 --> 00:01:36,570
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font color="#cdcdcc">Natural Enemy</font></font>

39
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:57,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They blew up...
They blew up and died!</font>

40
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I expected I'm not sad.</font>

41
00:02:02,220 --> 00:02:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really can't hold funerals
feeling like this, huh...</font>

42
00:02:11,060 --> 00:02:12,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Four of them are still alive.</font>

43
00:02:13,610 --> 00:02:16,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Can't be! After being hit
by my Lightning Fang...</font>

44
00:02:17,950 --> 00:02:18,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No...</font>

45
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you say so it has to be true.</font>

46
00:02:22,450 --> 00:02:24,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One... is troublesome...</font>

47
00:02:29,250 --> 00:02:34,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The enemy was nearby...
But I couldn't see anything.</font>

48
00:02:36,010 --> 00:02:36,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's strange...</font>

49
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it's the Hidden Mist Jutsu</font>

50
00:02:40,220 --> 00:02:42,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my Byakugan should be able
to see through it.</font>

51
00:02:44,060 --> 00:02:44,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

52
00:02:46,310 --> 00:02:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For sure this time...</font>

53
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:52,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can see it!</font>

54
00:02:53,020 --> 00:02:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Southwest 52 degrees 2!</font>

55
00:02:57,240 --> 00:02:59,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Southeast 12 degrees 3!</font>

56
00:03:01,820 --> 00:03:04,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Southeast 8 degrees 1!</font>

57
00:03:05,870 --> 00:03:09,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Northwest 24 degrees 11!</font>

58
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

59
00:03:18,550 --> 00:03:19,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

60
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leaf Hurricane!</font>

61
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

62
00:03:34,980 --> 00:03:35,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

63
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">U-zu-ma-ki Barrage!</font>

64
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I missed!</font>

65
00:03:49,660 --> 00:03:51,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Help me!</font>

66
00:03:53,830 --> 00:03:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bushy Brow...?</font>

67
00:03:56,170 --> 00:03:58,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-The enemy disappeared!</font>

68
00:04:09,470 --> 00:04:13,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be...
The false images with Chakra Networks?</font>

69
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:20,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One at the middle of the cliff,
one at the bottom of the cliff</font>

70
00:04:20,940 --> 00:04:23,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">one on the right, one on the left.</font>

71
00:04:24,570 --> 00:04:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't hold funerals</font>

72
00:04:26,570 --> 00:04:29,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'll take care of them
without leaving any trace.</font>

73
00:04:34,170 --> 00:04:37,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thunder Funeral: Feast of Lightning!</font>

74
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:54,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The corpses are warm.</font>

75
00:04:56,310 --> 00:04:59,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're strong... you and I.</font>

76
00:05:00,570 --> 00:05:01,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's you.</font>

77
00:05:02,610 --> 00:05:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru, you're strong.
With you I'm also strong.</font>

78
00:05:08,450 --> 00:05:13,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait... They aren't dead yet.
They're just unconscious.</font>

79
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're stubborn.</font>

80
00:05:16,290 --> 00:05:19,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, if grilling doesn't work
then let's chop them.</font>

81
00:05:21,840 --> 00:05:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Flesh and even bone...
I'll crush them nicely.</font>

82
00:05:30,350 --> 00:05:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru...! Are you all right?!</font>

83
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang in there, Ranmaru!</font>

84
00:05:39,650 --> 00:05:40,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru...!</font>

85
00:05:42,610 --> 00:05:43,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay.</font>

86
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:46,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga...</font>

87
00:05:47,740 --> 00:05:50,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This person... is still unconscious.</font>

88
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

89
00:05:55,290 --> 00:05:56,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's amazing...</font>

90
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is fighting
only with muscle memory.</font>

91
00:06:00,170 --> 00:06:03,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a nice face.
It burns into my heart.</font>

92
00:06:04,760 --> 00:06:07,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hold a funeral for him...</font>

93
00:06:07,380 --> 00:06:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am sure it will be one
that will make me cry!</font>

94
00:06:10,340 --> 00:06:11,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the right!</font>

95
00:06:12,010 --> 00:06:13,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with this guy...?</font>

96
00:06:13,350 --> 00:06:15,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's hard to read. The moves...</font>

97
00:06:15,470 --> 00:06:18,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But for your sake Raiga
I'll do my best.</font>

98
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Together okay!</font>

99
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Left!
— Right!</font>

100
00:06:22,650 --> 00:06:24,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the front! Jump! Now!</font>

101
00:06:28,110 --> 00:06:30,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... you... you!</font>

102
00:06:31,910 --> 00:06:32,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

103
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:35,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How can this guy...
get to this point?</font>

104
00:06:49,510 --> 00:06:50,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-Bushy Brows...</font>

105
00:06:59,640 --> 00:07:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee...
Could he have lost consciousness...?</font>

106
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tenten! Neji!</font>

107
00:07:13,410 --> 00:07:15,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga! Turn around!</font>

108
00:07:16,290 --> 00:07:18,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What...? That voice right now...?</font>

109
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:22,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha—?!</font>

110
00:07:22,540 --> 00:07:23,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga!</font>

111
00:07:24,210 --> 00:07:25,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru!</font>

112
00:07:26,880 --> 00:07:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This is...
— Neji...</font>

113
00:07:29,010 --> 00:07:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru!</font>

114
00:07:30,090 --> 00:07:30,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Move!</font>

115
00:07:33,260 --> 00:07:36,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Somehow... it felt like
I was fighting in my dreams...</font>

116
00:07:39,390 --> 00:07:40,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru...</font>

117
00:07:44,940 --> 00:07:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

118
00:07:51,110 --> 00:07:53,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh! Uzumaki Naruto arrives!</font>

119
00:07:54,410 --> 00:07:55,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

120
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:57,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just die already...</font>

121
00:07:57,910 --> 00:08:01,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! I have something
I want to ask you!</font>

122
00:08:01,540 --> 00:08:05,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... I heard you're one of
the Seven Ninja Swordsmen of the Mist.</font>

123
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:10,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So what if I was?!</font>

124
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:13,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know Zabuza, right?!</font>

125
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:18,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You also know...
one called Kisame, right?!</font>

126
00:08:20,980 --> 00:08:25,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... hate them!
Who wants to remember them?!</font>

127
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate you too!</font>

128
00:08:28,900 --> 00:08:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then!</font>

129
00:08:29,820 --> 00:08:31,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll make you tell me by force!</font>

130
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A clone?!</font>

131
00:08:37,370 --> 00:08:39,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... You're weaker
than a moment ago.</font>

132
00:08:43,910 --> 00:08:45,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What...?</font>

133
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:46,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning Ball!</font>

134
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn...</font>

135
00:08:57,050 --> 00:08:59,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, you are tough...</font>

136
00:09:00,510 --> 00:09:01,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning Ball!</font>

137
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:15,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seconds please...</font>

138
00:09:21,910 --> 00:09:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}"CURRY OF LIFE SHOP"</b></font>

139
00:09:32,840 --> 00:09:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Grandma Sansho?</font>

140
00:09:34,470 --> 00:09:35,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong?</font>

141
00:09:36,300 --> 00:09:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my. That's bad lightning.</font>

142
00:09:39,930 --> 00:09:44,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was flashing like that too when
Karashi went to the village.</font>

143
00:09:44,980 --> 00:09:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my... that light is like poison...</font>

144
00:09:54,110 --> 00:09:55,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

145
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:06,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not... working at all.</font>

146
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:14,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not going to
remember your smile!</font>

147
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:15,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die!</font>

148
00:10:18,470 --> 00:10:20,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru... where are you?</font>

149
00:10:22,390 --> 00:10:24,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is in this bag...?</font>

150
00:10:26,350 --> 00:10:27,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

151
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:35,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's... in here...</font>

152
00:10:40,110 --> 00:10:40,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Could it be?</font>

153
00:10:50,710 --> 00:10:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This powder was...
hiding the Chakra Networks?</font>

154
00:10:59,880 --> 00:11:02,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's even creating the Chakra Network!</font>

155
00:11:09,810 --> 00:11:11,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!
Do the Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

156
00:11:13,190 --> 00:11:15,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But he saw all the shadow clones...</font>

157
00:11:16,070 --> 00:11:19,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry.
His eyes are right here!</font>

158
00:11:20,740 --> 00:11:24,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ranmaru! I'm gonna come save you
after I defeat this guy!</font>

159
00:11:25,870 --> 00:11:27,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

160
00:11:30,410 --> 00:11:32,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come bring it on!</font>

161
00:11:34,540 --> 00:11:35,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lightning Ball!</font>

162
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Was the one before a lucky hit?</font>

163
00:11:40,630 --> 00:11:44,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop messing around.
All I have to do is defeat you all right?!</font>

164
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:46,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go!</font>

165
00:11:49,020 --> 00:11:50,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're not done yet!</font>

166
00:11:50,560 --> 00:11:51,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...</font>

167
00:11:53,770 --> 00:11:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate... my Chakra will...</font>

168
00:11:57,110 --> 00:12:00,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mist...
The Hidden Mist Jutsu is fading away...</font>

169
00:12:00,110 --> 00:12:02,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! I'll finish them off at once!</font>

170
00:12:04,110 --> 00:12:04,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

171
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:12,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am not going to let you get away!</font>

172
00:12:15,460 --> 00:12:16,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wait!</font>

173
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Boulder Avalanche.</font>

174
00:12:25,470 --> 00:12:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

175
00:12:30,350 --> 00:12:31,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

176
00:12:38,860 --> 00:12:39,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did you see that...?!</font>

177
00:12:39,820 --> 00:12:40,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, I saw it!</font>

178
00:12:42,070 --> 00:12:43,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Prepare yourself!</font>

179
00:12:44,110 --> 00:12:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it!</font>

180
00:12:48,740 --> 00:12:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't stop!</font>

181
00:12:59,750 --> 00:13:01,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... did it.</font>

182
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:05,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... Raiga's eye...?</font>

183
00:13:08,260 --> 00:13:10,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a big eyeball!</font>

184
00:13:10,390 --> 00:13:11,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

185
00:13:11,430 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong...
It's a human being!</font>

186
00:13:18,190 --> 00:13:19,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?!</font>

187
00:13:20,650 --> 00:13:21,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In my dream...</font>

188
00:13:22,070 --> 00:13:25,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess you were the one
I was fighting against.</font>

189
00:13:25,450 --> 00:13:28,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It wasn't me...
It was Raiga and me together...</font>

190
00:13:29,330 --> 00:13:30,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Together...?</font>

191
00:13:30,910 --> 00:13:33,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Always... since that time...</font>

192
00:14:08,030 --> 00:14:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't act like you're asleep.
You are going to die...</font>

193
00:14:14,330 --> 00:14:15,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't move!</font>

194
00:14:16,080 --> 00:14:20,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is a spy in this village
who snuck into the Hidden Mist Village...</font>

195
00:14:20,170 --> 00:14:23,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We came to kill those guys but...</font>

196
00:14:23,960 --> 00:14:30,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got confused about who I had to kill.
That's why I am doing it randomly...</font>

197
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What are you saying?</font>

198
00:14:40,230 --> 00:14:43,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's fine...
If I am going to be killed by you.</font>

199
00:14:43,650 --> 00:14:47,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?
Why is it fine for me to kill you...?</font>

200
00:14:48,610 --> 00:14:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were... always crying...</font>

201
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:54,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Me... cry?</font>

202
00:14:55,790 --> 00:15:00,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In your heart...
seeking the meaning of living.</font>

203
00:15:02,420 --> 00:15:05,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was always watching... you.</font>

204
00:15:07,760 --> 00:15:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What... are you?</font>

205
00:15:11,220 --> 00:15:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am the same as you...
living is painful.</font>

206
00:15:16,010 --> 00:15:18,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't understand
the meaning of living.</font>

207
00:15:19,440 --> 00:15:21,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of my sickness
I couldn't go outside...</font>

208
00:15:21,850 --> 00:15:23,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shunned by everyone,</font>

209
00:15:23,810 --> 00:15:26,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all I could do was to take
a peek of the world from this blanket...</font>

210
00:15:27,990 --> 00:15:29,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... if with my death</font>

211
00:15:29,950 --> 00:15:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if you are able to feel
the meaning of life even a little...</font>

212
00:15:38,950 --> 00:15:40,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My life was not needed
from the beginning.</font>

213
00:15:44,630 --> 00:15:45,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

214
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:51,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you... alone?</font>

215
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come with me.</font>

216
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now on,
you and I are two as one.</font>

217
00:16:10,070 --> 00:16:14,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From that day on,
I became Raiga's eyes and ears.</font>

218
00:16:18,700 --> 00:16:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Raiga became my hands and feet.</font>

219
00:16:26,710 --> 00:16:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The outside world that I dashed
into for the very first time...</font>

220
00:16:29,340 --> 00:16:34,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was filled with things
I had never seen or heard before.</font>

221
00:16:36,010 --> 00:16:37,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was fun.</font>

222
00:16:42,230 --> 00:16:45,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Whenever and wherever
I was with Raiga.</font>

223
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:47,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter when it was</font>

224
00:16:47,810 --> 00:16:50,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there wasn't a time
that we were separated.</font>

225
00:17:18,720 --> 00:17:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were trying to find the meaning of life
by living for each other.</font>

226
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:27,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We were convinced that
was the meaning to living.</font>

227
00:17:37,450 --> 00:17:38,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why...</font>

228
00:17:38,660 --> 00:17:41,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Raiga is not around</font>

229
00:17:41,990 --> 00:17:45,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I no longer have the power
to live by myself.</font>

230
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've lost the purpose to live...</font>

231
00:17:51,380 --> 00:17:54,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you have someone
precious to you?</font>

232
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:57,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to protect
someone important to me...</font>

233
00:17:58,220 --> 00:18:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to make his dream come true
and that's my dream.</font>

234
00:18:04,640 --> 00:18:08,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Often people have it wrong...</font>

235
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">mistakenly believing that showing mercy
to an enemy is kindness.</font>

236
00:18:13,150 --> 00:18:15,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They spare the foe
whose life is in their hands.</font>

237
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:21,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not mercy to me at all...</font>

238
00:18:23,490 --> 00:18:30,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you know the agony of just living
without dreams and being unwanted?</font>

239
00:18:33,550 --> 00:18:35,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying?</font>

240
00:18:35,590 --> 00:18:42,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Zabuza has no use for a weak Shinobi.
You've taken away my reason for living.</font>

241
00:18:44,970 --> 00:18:47,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I no longer need to live.</font>

242
00:18:50,810 --> 00:18:54,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say such stupid things.</font>

243
00:18:54,940 --> 00:18:59,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... Please kill me!</font>

244
00:19:00,280 --> 00:19:01,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

245
00:19:01,620 --> 00:19:03,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you doing?</font>

246
00:19:06,410 --> 00:19:09,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now quickly.</font>

247
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:12,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you hesitating...?</font>

248
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:17,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With my arms and legs torn apart
I have no means to resist you know.</font>

249
00:19:21,300 --> 00:19:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You should carry out your mission....</font>

250
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry and deliver your finishing blow.</font>

251
00:19:30,730 --> 00:19:34,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our mission is to force out
the Kurosuki Family from this village...</font>

252
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:40,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without Raiga he cannot be
of any threat to this village.</font>

253
00:19:43,740 --> 00:19:45,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The problem right now is that</font>

254
00:19:45,580 --> 00:19:48,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Kurosuki Family members
have lost their leadership.</font>

255
00:19:49,370 --> 00:19:52,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once the hoop comes off
we don't know what they will do.</font>

256
00:19:58,380 --> 00:20:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For this mission...
this is the finishing touch.</font>

257
00:20:03,760 --> 00:20:08,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, but what are we
going to do with him?</font>

258
00:20:17,320 --> 00:20:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he a villain worth tying up?</font>

259
00:20:20,110 --> 00:20:21,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, he is not.</font>

260
00:20:22,110 --> 00:20:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He might kill himself, right?</font>

261
00:20:25,820 --> 00:20:29,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once the mission is over
we will come save you right away...</font>

262
00:20:35,830 --> 00:20:37,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A Chakra Sealing tag?</font>

263
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can't help it.
He is an enemy after all...</font>

264
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:47,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We should assume he has other Jutsu.
Just in case!</font>

265
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>dokomademo tsudzuku michi ni wa ironna koto arunda ne</b></font></font></font></font>

266
00:21:20,010 --> 00:21:31,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>so many things happen on this endless road, right?</b></font></font></font></font>

267
00:21:31,690 --> 00:21:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>tsuyogari na kimi ga kyou wa juwaki koshi ni namida koe</b></font></font></font></font>

268
00:21:31,690 --> 00:21:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>although you're strong-willed your voice wavered on the phone today</b></font></font></font></font>

269
00:21:43,290 --> 00:21:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>donna yume oikakete kokomade kitan darou</b></font></font></font></font>

270
00:21:43,290 --> 00:21:54,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>what dreams did you chase to get here?</b></font></font></font></font>

271
00:21:54,080 --> 00:22:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>wakara na kunattari suru koto wa boku ni datte aru kara nee BABY</b></font></font></font></font>

272
00:21:54,080 --> 00:22:06,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even I have times when I just don't understand baby</b></font></font></font></font>

273
00:22:06,420 --> 00:22:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>kimi ga namida no toki ni wa boku ga soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

274
00:22:06,420 --> 00:22:17,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>when you're sad I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

275
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>hanareba nare no yoru datte boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

276
00:22:17,940 --> 00:22:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>even on nights when we're apart I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

277
00:22:29,540 --> 00:22:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>boku wa soba ni iru kara</b></font></font></font></font>

278
00:22:29,540 --> 00:22:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#eddee0"><font face="Patrick Hand"><font size="27"><b>I'll be close to you</b></font></font></font></font>

279
00:22:40,280 --> 00:22:42,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Rokusuke and the others
went back to the village</font>

280
00:22:42,610 --> 00:22:43,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">so I say the mission is complete.</font>

281
00:22:44,030 --> 00:22:45,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Except Lee.</font>

282
00:22:45,110 --> 00:22:46,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Oh, oh, yeah.</font>

283
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:49,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Bushy Brow said he was
going to straighten Karashi's spirit.</font>

284
00:22:49,740 --> 00:22:51,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I wonder if it's going to be
that easy.</font>

285
00:22:51,910 --> 00:22:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">It seems like
there will be some trouble.</font>

286
00:22:53,250 --> 00:22:55,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey, why are you saying that?!</font>

287
00:22:55,120 --> 00:22:58,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">No, not Karashi but this weather.</font>

288
00:22:59,290 --> 00:23:01,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The Dark Cloud Sneaks Up."</font>

289
00:23:01,710 --> 00:23:04,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I see. There's going to be a storm.</font>

